{"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Tracking-the-lifecycle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"],"title":"Tracking the lifecycle"},{"anchor":"Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"],"title":"Events"},{"anchor":"Keeping-the-version","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore"],"title":"Keeping the version"},{"anchor":"Delivering-as-the-app-leaves","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy"],"title":"Delivering as the app leaves"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Afluent"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Track the app’s installs, updates, opens, moves to the background and terminations, and make the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s records durable as the app leaves the foreground.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this module to track the application’s lifecycle on any platform. Nothing is tracked until","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackLifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on its tracker as it launches, and keeps the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" it returns; tracking stops when that is cancelled, finished or released.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For the screens and controls inside the app, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/automatictracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As it starts, it compares the app’s version (","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleShortVersionString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by default, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"version:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") with the one its ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","isActive":true},{"text":" saved at the last launch. No saved version tracks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","isActive":true},{"text":", a different one ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","isActive":true},{"text":", the same one neither. Then it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracks ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","isActive":true},{"text":". After that, from ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s, ","type":"text"},{"code":"WKApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s notifications, it tracks ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","isActive":true},{"text":" from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the background and, where the platform reports it, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated","isActive":true},{"text":", each once per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition. A server or a tool on Linux has no notifications, so it calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","isActive":true},{"text":" as it ends:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle(version: \"2.1\", versionStore: InMemoryVersionStore(version: \"2.0\"))","\/\/ tracks ApplicationUpdated(previousVersion: \"2.0\", version: \"2.1\"), then ApplicationOpened(fromBackground: false)","","\/\/ ... the process's work ...","","await lifecycle.finish()  \/\/ tracks ApplicationTerminated","await tracker.finish()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The store keeps the version and nothing else. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore"},{"text":" keeps it in a file, by default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"beside a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SegmentStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s records; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore"},{"text":" keeps it in memory, for tests; any type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of yours can conform. ","type":"text"},{"code":"kinds:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" turns kinds of event off, while the version is still saved.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As the app leaves the foreground, it waits for the tracker’s worker to write every record tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so far to the tracker’s store, then calls the store’s "},{"code":"synchronize()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A delivery batched with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":".lifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") sends what is pending as it reads the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded"},{"type":"text","text":" record. The notification’s handler only hands the transition on; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work runs on a task of its own, and where the system suspends apps in the background it holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background time until the records are durable."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"LifecycleTracking","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"LifecycleTracking"}],"role":"collection","title":"LifecycleTracking","symbolKind":"module"},"variants"